  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 2,500eb (V. Expensive)</p>\n<p><strong>Mods:</strong> All Non-Explosive Ranged Weapons</p>\n<p><em>An acidic, ranged solution to the ‘corpo armor problem.’</em></p>\n<p>Can only be installed into Excellent Quality Weapons. Whenever a target is hit by an attack from the weapon, they are also hit by an Acid Paintball. The Acid Paintball deals no damage, but marks the target in a splash of paint (with whatever color the user desires) and lowers the SP of the target’s armor in the location hit by 1, even if the attack’s damage did not surpass the target’s SP.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Weapon Mods).</em></p>"
